{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>Sword.</b> Corresponding to ״וחרב לא תעבור בארצכם״, and concerning it is written ״חרב תאאכלו״ etc. ״Nekom nakam berit״ — a covenant that you violated, as it is written ״הנה דם הברית אשר כרת HaShem עמכם״, and this is the first. A sword and a book descended bound together from heaven, as it is written ״אם תאבו ושמעתם״ etc. ״ואם תמאנו ומריתם״ etc. Here Rashi explained: there is vengeance that is not in the covenant, etc. — meaning, there is yet vengeance that is not written in the Torah that is called ברית, as it is written ״אלה דברי הברית״, and this is blinding of eyes, and this vengeance is not written in the Torah." "<b>And you shall be gathered to your cities.</b> Because of the sword; but it will not avail, for there I will send דבר, and the mighty shall die and the weak shall be given into the enemy's hand. ״ונאספתם״ corresponds to ״ואולך אתכם קוממיות״, and this is the second." "<b>And I will send דבר among you.</b> Corresponding to ״ומאה מכם״, and this is the third." "<b>And you shall be given into the enemy's hand.</b> Corresponding to ״רבבה ירדופו״, and this is the fourth."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:15:37.933882020Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}